---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { siteConfig } from "../data/site";
import { withBasePath } from "../lib/paths";
---

<BaseLayout title="关于" description={siteConfig.author.shortBio} wideContent={true} bodyClass="body--about" shellClass="page-shell--archive" panelClass="content-panel--archive">
  <article class="about-page">
    <a class="post-backlink" href={withBasePath("/")}>← 返回首页</a>
    <header><h1>关于</h1><p>{siteConfig.author.name}</p></header>
    <div class="about-page__layout">
      <div class="about-page__copy">
        <p>{siteConfig.author.shortBio}</p>
        <p>{siteConfig.author.bio}</p>
        <p>我把这里当成一个长期维护的公开日记本。写下来的东西未必成熟，但会尽量诚实，也愿意随着经验继续修改自己的判断。</p>
      </div>
      <figure class="about-page__portrait"><img src={withBasePath(siteConfig.author.portrait)} alt={`${siteConfig.author.name} 的照片`} width="900" height="1200" /></figure>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
